sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Customer
  participant ACD as Contact center
  participant PSA as PSA
  participant P as Phone platform
  participant A as Priya
  participant R as Raj
  C->>ACD: Calls the contact center
  ACD->>A: Delivers the call through Priya's phone
  ACD-->>PSA: Priya: Working
  PSA->>P: Publisher side: Priya's presence Busy
  A->>P: Dials Raj's extension to bring him in
  P-->>PSA: Raj: call connected, extension
  PSA->>ACD: Subscriber side: Raj Unavailable-UC
  Note over C,R: Customer, Priya and Raj on one call
  A->>P: Priya drops off, warm transfer done
  ACD-->>PSA: Priya: Available
  PSA->>P: Priya's presence Available
  Note over R: Raj stays busy until his own leg ends
  R->>P: Raj hangs up
  P-->>PSA: Raj: call ended
  PSA->>ACD: Raj back to his last permanent state
